{"v":3,"catch":"突破極限──賽車的未來，即刻啟動！","desc":"突破極限，稱霸賽道！\n\n準備迎接《Formula Racing Pro 2026》帶來的次世代速度革命！感受腎上腺素的極致飆升！迎戰更快、更聰明的對手，並在以全球指標性賽道為發想的全新賽場上盡情馳騁。\n\n強化圖像表現、升級物理引擎與動態天氣系統，讓每一圈都充滿真實張力。掌握過彎路線、應對路況變化，在激烈對決中爭奪冠軍寶座。\n\n不論你是職業級老手還是初次上場，《Formula Racing Pro 2026》都能讓你體驗純粹的競速熱血，感受輕鬆上手、極速且永無止境的刺激！\n\n調整你的賽車，全速向頒獎台衝刺，證明你就是場上最快的賽車手。賽車的未來，即刻啟動！","publisher":"Baltoro Minis","release":"2025-12-18","genres":["競速","運動","街機","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文","韓文","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 1.3GB / Switch 1.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/210cf285ed765e315beb912b78176d3a4f5e2f2535ac8bf93766658764e09a83.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bd72ed48a1ae5efbbb46e86100277d7c82207ed9f6143f0beb62349f35a1eebe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/136b07133677ad711c995e77c2cb2b190ddbc004b50dff8dc3bb8bebfd44e0ee.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b1dacaa4a4c2e20b31614ea84f14ec739fac7010b91c7a17f2e69aefd80c8e59.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/df8c788da79d054eef4a52c705f8d6e653690afc5ee4ec7ab0690fb72ee99552.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9f7775606dd6e19faf079e1c36b795a5a3de60a8cdef2839a0d3481b8bd12117.jpg"],"titleId":"0100213025eb4000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000067595","name":"Formula Racing Pro 2026 職業方程式賽車 2026: Expansion Pack #1","img":"41ce6ec23a89bbf48bbcfbc3d9802996e04f205066a8f3daaedcd5fc2bd4a8be","date":"2026-01-15","mem":false},{"id":"70050000067596","name":"Formula Racing Pro 2026 職業方程式賽車 2026: Expansion Pack #2","img":"7103a56a14e88ef821e5b9028c520bc553ac209e7b380dadb740387287ee0b75","date":"2026-01-15","mem":false},{"id":"70050000067597","name":"Formula Racing Pro 2026 職業方程式賽車 2026: Expansion Pack #3","img":"251a3fe5a6a2454b7cc46336cd6accaa99911145626b3428ee4fcf19b963e7cc","date":"2026-01-15","mem":false},{"id":"70050000067598","name":"Formula Racing Pro 2026 職業方程式賽車 2026: Expansion Pack #4","img":"857b40d37d2927714d371aa44